1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,080
Normal places.

2
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:02,340
Hannibal has a different idea.

3
00:00:02,390 --> 00:00:04,320
He's going to march overland.

4
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:05,820
Through the Pyrenees.

5
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,420
Across southern France.

6
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:08,500
Over the Alps.

7
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,440
In autumn.

8
00:00:09,490 --> 00:00:11,120
With war elephants.

9
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:12,660
It was insane.

10
00:00:12,710 --> 00:00:15,620
He lost half his men on the way.

11
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,920
Almost all the elephants died.

12
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,130
Soldiers froze.

13
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:21,740
Rockslides buried whole units.

14
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,060
But in the end...

15
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:26,100
...a Carthaginian army appeared in northern Italy.

16
00:00:26,150 --> 00:00:27,600
Out of nowhere.

17
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:29,750
Rome didn't see it coming.

